
# Boiling Point Non-Hydrostatic Signal Test

This notebook implements the boiling point non-hydrostatic signal test. We calculate the hydrostatic boiling point baseline using the Antoine equation, generate synthetic meteorological data, and test for non-hydrostatic signals by correlating boiling point prediction error with vertical wind velocity.

---

